{"id":"625286","name":"柠檬鸡爪","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/625286/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡爪","amount":"1000g"}],"sub":[{"name":"柠檬","amount":"2个"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米椒","amount":"4个"},{"name":"泡椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡爪清洗干净后，剪去指甲。","img":"images/625286/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"一个鸡爪切开3份，可以更好的入味。","img":"images/625286/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切好的鸡爪放入水中再次清洗干净。","img":"images/625286/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"鸡爪凉水入锅，放入葱、姜、花椒、料酒。","img":"images/625286/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"煮开后捞去浮沫。","img":"images/625286/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"盖上盖，继续煮6分钟。","img":"images/625286/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"时间到捞出。","img":"images/625286/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入水(矿泉水或凉白开)中浸泡。","img":"images/625286/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"准备蒜头、小米椒、柠檬、青泡椒。","img":"images/625286/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"柠檬先用盐搓洗干净，切开后去核，其余配料切成粒即可。","img":"images/625286/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"鸡爪沥干水分后，倒所有配料。","img":"images/625286/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入适量的酱油、陈醋。","img":"images/625286/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入适量的矿泉水。","img":"images/625286/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/625286/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再放入容器内。","img":"images/625286/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"盖上盖，存入冰箱放置一晚。","img":"images/625286/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。这么做的鸡爪酸辣入味，清新爽口！","img":"images/625286/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}